description:
@req:8050@
Sears the target and 2 nearby enemies with Frostfire, causing ${$m1+0+$sp*0.165+$ap*0.159} Frostfire damage immediately and ${($m2+$sp*0.1+$ap*0.07)*4} Frostfire damage over $donds. @ext:This periodic damage can critically strike, benefits from spell haste and can trigger Fingers of Frost.:ext@

@ext:This ability shares a cooldown with Shaman Shock spells. :ext@

@unlockby:1752@
Fires your pistol to deal $s3% of your normal ranged weapon damage. Awards $s2 combo $lpoint:points; and grants you |cFFFFFFFFGunslinger's Strike|r. 

@ext:This can trigger |cFFFFFFFFPiercing Shots|r, |cFFFFFFFFExpose Weakness|r and |cFFFFFFFFMaster Tactician|r.:ext@

@unlockby:772@
Strike the target causing them to take poison damage for $o1 damage plus an additional ${0.2*5*(($MWB+$mwb)/2+$AP/14*$MWS)} (based on weapon damage) over $d.

This ability is usable while shapeshifted.

@unlockby:689@
A magical attack that deals $s2% weapon damage as Shadow damage and deals $s1 damage every second and heals you for 10% of the damage done for $d.

This ability can Periodically critically strike.
